  "instructions": [
    "Fill a large pot with the water and bring to a boil.",
    "Add the pasta to the pot and cook until al dente.",
    "Reserve 1 cup of pasta water before draining the noodles.",
    "Mix the reserved pasta water with the fish sauce and sesame oil in a small bowl.",
    "Slice the garlic and ginger into thin pieces and add to the bowl.",
    "Chop the green onions and add to the bowl.",
    "Stir the mixture until it forms a smooth emulsion.",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the bamboo steamer and pour the emulsion over the top.",
    "Sprinkle the toasted sesame seeds over the noodles and serve."
